SUMMARY:Civic Meetup: Privacy and Discrimination Risks of Health-related
  Machine Listening - by Civic Tech Toronto
LOCATION:Hybrid
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://guild.host/events/civic-meetup-559-creeped-1zbsks\n\nHosted by
  Civic Tech Toronto (https://civictech.ca/)\n\nThis talk focuses
  health-related machine listening: apps and devices that combine audio
  processing and machine learning to produce sensitive inferences about
  people’s health from data points such as vocal biomarkers\, coughs\,
  infant cries\, and other sounds. Drawing on a 10-year analysis\, the
  presentation will show the escalating privacy risks. Followed by breakout
  groups.
END:VEVENT
