 tration\n\nHosted by Canadian Climate Institute
  (https://climateinstitute.ca/)\n\nOn September 3rd\, the federal
  government released Canada's Changing Climate Report 2026—a landmark
  scientific assessment summarizing how climate change will impact Canada.
  The report shows that Canada must prepare for a future that is up to 5°C
  hotter and act now to avoid the worst impacts.
