  (https://www.drugpolicy.ca/)\n\nWhat do mercury poisoning in Grassy
  Narrows First Nation and Coca leaf eradication in the Amazon and Pacific
  rainforest have in common? Join the Canadian Drug Policy Coalition for a
  conversation exploring how Indigenous and racialized communities
  experience environmental harm\, criminalization\, and state neglect\, and
  what meaningful solidarity across struggles can look like.
