SUMMARY:Rally for Personal Support Workers - by Ontario Council of Hospital
  Unions
LOCATION:777 Bay St
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/DdEuGYBNhmA/\n\nHosted
  by Ontario Council of Hospital Unions (https://ochu.on.ca/)\n\nPSWs
  deserve the same fundamental rights and protections as other regulated
  professionals in Ontario. Stand with PSWs as they demand fair
  representation and due process under the Health and Supportive Care
  Providers Oversight Authority!
END:VEVENT
