SUMMARY:Under a Common Sky: Faisal Anwar on Hybrid Art & Climate Care - by
  Goethe-Institut Toronto
LOCATION:Goethe-Institut Toronto
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/under-a-common-sky-faisal-anwar-on-hybrid-art
 -climate-care-tickets-1998903636586\n\nHosted by Goethe-Institut Toronto
  (https://www.goethe.de/ins/ca/en/sta/tor.html)\n\nWhat does it look like
  to care for a living planet when art\, science\, technology & ancestral
  knowledge tell different parts of the story? Join immersive artist Faisal
  Anwar for a conversation about climate memory\, ecological change and the
  possibilities of art to connect knowledge systems—and rethink our
  relationship with Earth’s living systems.
END:VEVENT
